[{"answer":"Good morning, everyone, and welcome to Stevenson's,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/1.mp3"},{"answer":"one of the country's major manufacturers of metal goods.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/2-2023-02-25-12-02-44.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you for choosing us for your two weeks of work experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/3.mp3"},{"answer":"My name is Julia Simmons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/4.mp3"},{"answer":"and since the beginning of this year I've been the managing director.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Stevenson's is quite an old company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Like me, the founder, Ronald Stevenson, went into the steel industry when he left school,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/7.mp3"},{"answer":"that was in 1923.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/8.mp3"},{"answer":"He set up this company when he finished his apprenticeship, in 1926,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/9.mp3"},{"answer":"although he actually started making plans two years earlier, in 1924.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/10.mp3"},{"answer":"He was a very determined young man!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Stevenson's long-term plan was to manufacture components for the machine tools industry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/12.mp3"},{"answer":"although in fact that never came about,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and for the automotive industry, that is, cars and lorries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/14.mp3"},{"answer":"However, there was a delay of five years before that happened,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/15.mp3"},{"answer":"because shortly before the company went into production,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Stevenson was given the opportunity to make goods for hospitals","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and other players in the healthcare industry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/18.mp3"},{"answer":"so that's what we did for the first five years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Over the years, we've expanded the premises considerably,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/20.mp3"},{"answer":"we were lucky that the site is big enough,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/21.mp3"},{"answer":"so moving to a new location has never been necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/22.mp3"},{"answer":"However, the layout is far from ideal for modern machinery and production methods,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/23.mp3"},{"answer":"so we intend to carry out major refurbishment of this site over the next five years.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd better give you some idea of what you'll be doing during your two weeks with us,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/25.mp3"},{"answer":"so you know what to expect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Most mornings you'll have a presentation from one of the managers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/27.mp3"},{"answer":"to learn about their department, starting this morning with research and development.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And you'll all spend some time in each department,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/29.mp3"},{"answer":"observing what's going on and talking to people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/30.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as you don't stop them from doing their work altogether!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/31.mp3"},{"answer":"In the past, a teacher from your school has come in at the end of each week","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/32.mp3"},{"answer":"to find out how the group were getting on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/33.mp3"},{"answer":"but your school isn't able to arrange that this year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/34.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now I'll briefly help you to orientate yourselves around the site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/35.mp3"},{"answer":"As you can see, we're in the reception area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/36.mp3"},{"answer":"which we try to make attractive and welcoming to visitors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/37.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a corridor running left from here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and if you go along that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/39.mp3"},{"answer":"the door facing you at the end is the entrance to the coffee room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/40.mp3"},{"answer":"This looks out onto the main road on one side, and some trees on the other,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and that'll be where you meet each morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/42.mp3"},{"answer":"The factory is the very big room on the far side of the site.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Next to it is the warehouse,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/44.mp3"},{"answer":"which can be accessed by lorries going up the road to the turning area at the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You can get to the warehouse by crossing to the far side of the courtyard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the door is on your right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Somewhere you'll be keen to find is the staff canteen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/48.mp3"},{"answer":"This is right next to reception.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I can confidently say that the food's very good,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but the view isn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/51.mp3"},{"answer":"The windows on one side look onto a corridor and courtyard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/52.mp3"},{"answer":"which aren't very attractive at all,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and on the other onto the access road, which isn't much better.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/54.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll be using the meeting room quite often,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'll find it by walking along the corridor to the left of the courtyard,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/56.mp3"},{"answer":"and continuing along it to the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/57.mp3"},{"answer":"The meeting room is the last one on the right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm afraid there's no natural daylight in the room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you'll need to know where some of the offices are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/60.mp3"},{"answer":"The human resources department is at the front of this building,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/61.mp3"},{"answer":"so you head to the left along the corridor from reception,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's the second room you come to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It looks out onto the main road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/64.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally, the boardroom, where you'll be meeting sometimes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/65.mp3"},{"answer":"That has quite a pleasant view, as it looks out onto the trees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Go along the corridor past the courtyard, right to the end.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/67.mp3"},{"answer":"The boardroom is on the left, next to the factory.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/68.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, now are there any questions...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-16-test-1-section-2-2022-12-28-23-22-39/69.mp3"}]
